an Kevin Lincoln, a former Stockton mayor, in a district reshaped by redistricting to include Stockton. The new lines carry a modest Democratic lean, and the national midterm environment favors Democrats, but Republicans have made the seat a priority, with the House Speaker campaigning for Lincoln and party groups directing money into the contest.\n\nNo public polls are available, so the picture rests on expert ratings and markets. Most analysts call the race Likely Democratic, and prediction markets price Gray's chances around 95 percent. Gray holds a clear fundraising edge, though Lincoln has attracted more outside support. Incumbency, money, and a favorable map point to a Gray win, while the thin 2024 margin leaves enough uncertainty to keep the race short of safe.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9502, "margin": 10.95}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9343, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.945, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.941, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9142, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9277, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9289, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9426, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9484, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9571, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9504, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9439, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9519, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9242, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9375, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9272, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9359, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9277, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9242, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9307, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.945, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "20